    <div class="chapter reveal"><span class="bignum">03</span><div class="num">Chapter Three</div><div class="orn"><span class="d"></span></div><h2 id="four">The four jobs to hand over first</h2></div>
    <p class="answer reveal">The four business tasks to hand AI first are drafting content, repurposing one piece into many, summarising long material, and structuring your rough thinking into a clear plan.</p>
    <p class="reveal">You do not need to reinvent your whole business around AI. You need to find the four places it saves you the most time and start there. Every one of these is something you are already doing by hand, slowly.</p>

