      <p>save it where you can find it →</p>
      <p>each week, swap in the new topic →</p>
      <p>edit the draft with your own hand →</p>
      <p>and the work that ate an afternoon takes twenty minutes.</p>
      <span class="pin-note">this is what "running without you" starts as ♡</span>
    </div>

    <div class="box action reveal"><span class="tag"><span class="g">→</span> Action Step</span><h4>Write one brief, save it, reuse it</h4><p>Pick the one task you do every week — captions, your newsletter, pin copy. Write it a full four-part brief today, save it somewhere permanent, and reuse it next week. That single saved brief is your first real system.</p><a class="btn dark" href="/learn/complete-automation-guide">The Automation Guide <span class="a">→</span></a></div>

